:: Act3_School_Foyer {"position":"800,1700","size":"100,100"}
<<nobr>>
<<set $currentLocation to "security_foyer">>
<<set $activeMap to "Highschool Ground">>
<<set _arrivedLate to (visited("Act2_5_MarcusCabin"))>>
<</nobr>>

<h2>GROUND FLOOR — SECURITY FOYER</h2>

<div style="margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: center;">
<<if _arrivedLate>>
    <img src="image/Act3_Timberline/lobby_morning.gif" style="max-width: 100%; border: 1px solid #333;">
<<else>>
    <img src="image/Act3_Timberline/lobby_night.gif" style="max-width: 100%; border: 1px solid #333;">
<</if>>
</div>

The main entrance foyer. Armed sentries guard the barricaded double doors against exterior threats.

<br><br>
<div class="choice-menu">
    <<if hasObjective("rescue_leader_711") and not isObjectiveCompleted("rescue_leader_711")>>
        <button style="border-left-color:var(--accent-red) !important; background: rgba(100, 0, 0, 0.25);">
            <<link "🚗 Depart for Route 9 7-Eleven [RESCUE LEADER]" "Act3_7Eleven_Arrival">>
            <</link>>
            <span class="btn-sub"><b style="color:var(--accent-red);">[ACTIVE RESCUE]</b> Drive out with Reyes to rescue Commander Miller at the 7-Eleven.</span>
        </button>
    <</if>>

    <button>
        <<link "➡️ Enter Screening Room [EAST]">>
            <<goto "Act3_School_Screening">>
        <</link>>
    </button>
    <button>
        <<link "⬆️ Walk North into Hallway Junction">>
            <<set $currentLocation to "hall_g_center">>
            <<goto "Act3_SchoolGFloor">>
        <</link>>
    </button>
</div>